-shiji060-003","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"oro_evn_khk"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003649"]},{"id":"oro_evn_khk_CA","label":"朝陽侯子（三王世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"朝陽侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0039"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p026","quote":"朝陽侯"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","source_id":"s-shiji-060-sanwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p026","quote":"會昭帝崩，宣帝初立，緣恩行義，以本始元年中，裂漢地，盡以封廣陵王胥四子：一子為朝陽侯；一子為平曲侯；一子為南利侯；最愛少子弘，立以為高密王。","source_term":"封廣陵王胥四子：一子為朝陽侯"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji060-005","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"oro_evn_khk_C"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003667"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-060-sanwang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-060","chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-060-sanwang:m026-0039"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-060-sanwang:p026"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-060-sanwang"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji060-005","subject_person_id":"oro_evn_khk_CA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"oro_evn_khk_C","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","source_id":"s-shiji-060-sanwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p026","quote":"會昭帝崩，宣帝初立，緣恩行義，以本始元年中，裂漢地，盡以封廣陵王胥四子：一子為朝陽侯